# Fast tier for pi-rukas. With this file the developer runs this command, not
# .pi/verify-cmd; the driver runs this and then .pi/verify-cmd wherever it
# gates. Only what the change since origin/main can affect: the name lint,
# shellcheck and the tests of the changed files, the workspace's tests when
# console/ changed. The heavy integration files (install_*, update_*,
# pack_release, bootstrap) are left to the full gate unless the change touches
# what they test. scripts/select-tests.sh says how paths map.
bash scripts/verify.sh --changed
